Agastya enters vast beastless Trētā forest --- Agastya finds lotus lake and empty ancient hermitage --- Agastya spends night and approaches lake at dawn --- Agastya sees fat undecaying corpse in water --- Agastya watches swan-yoked vimāna descend --- Heaven-dweller eats corpse with thousand apsaras attending --- Heaven-dweller bathes and boards vimāna --- Agastya halts ascender and asks censured conduct